Bundled libelf for Wraith
=========================

Source:
  https://github.com/arachsys/libelf
  Tag: v0.197 (commit fcd3951fd364)

This is the freestanding libelf extracted from elfutils 0.197. Wraith uses it
only when a usable system libelf is not found by configure.

Local changes:
  - Wraith builds and links only the static libelf.a.
  - Wraith uses the bundled src/elf.h with the public libelf headers.
  - Disable zstd support; keep zlib for compressed ELF sections.
  - Disable gettext/libintl and use untranslated error strings.
  - Use compiler byte-order/builtin byte-swap definitions for portability.
  - Use conservative libc feature fallbacks instead of Linux-specific values.

Keep the upstream README and license files alongside this note. Patches should
be kept minimal so future updates can be compared against upstream v0.197.
